3	\N	509112	25137	As a prequel to capturing General Ernest von Helmreich, the Rat Patrol gets itself captured. They plan to use the general to stop an upcoming attack. However the general manages to attract the attention of a distant Nazi search party and the Rat Patrol ends up trapped in a ravine, cut off. To escape they construct a ""fake panzer unit"" of their own -- tricking the Germans into a retreat. They then make it to the largest of the Germans' ammo dumps which they proceed to blow up.	/2o2B7PtGSOreHyxIYy2Or97V3n.jpg	The Wildest Raid of All	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/1/3
