3	\N	509140	25138	The Patrol attempts to destroy a small village that currently has a train in it that the Germans are loading with ammunition. However, there is a small group of Arabs (including women and children) being used to load the ammunition. One of the women stumbles upon Troy and offers to help by warning her people. But as Troy attempts to plant the explosives, Dietrich catches on to the plan and gives alarm. Troy ends up shot and captured. It is now up to the rest of the Patrol to cause enough diversion to get him free. The woman continues to plead with Dietrich to give Troy medical attention. As Dietrich is questioning Troy, though, Troy breaks free, shoots the German and is able—with the Arab woman's father's help—to get the explosives planted. The train goes up; the man is killed.	\N	The Trial by Fire Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/3
4	\N	509138	25138	Troy determines that the Rat Patrol's only chance to destroy a supply depot inside an enemy-held fortress is by capturing a German tank and using it to get past the guards.	\N	The Darers Go First Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/4
5	\N	509148	25138	When the patrol ambush an Afrika Korps supply column, Troy accidentally wounds a German nurse. Feeling guilty, Troy decides to take her to a German field hospital. The only problem is that on the way she overhears a piece of vital information.	\N	The Love Thine Enemy Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/5
6	\N	509145	25138	Troy infiltrates a German H.Q. posing as a blinded Afrika Korps officer to steal vital information.	\N	The Darkest Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/6
7	\N	509142	25138	En route to a meeting with an Arab agent, the patrol is ambushed by Dietrich. With the exception of Troy, they're all captured and taken to Dietrich's desert base. Troy eventually meets up with the agent, who turns out to be a teenage boy, and a female Irish teacher, but will she allow the boy to help Troy?	\N	The Death Do Us Part Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/7
8	\N	509149	25138	The Patrol is ordered to rescue pop star Mickey Roberts (singer Jack Jones), who is a P.O.W. in a small Afrika Korps compound, with the S.S. also turning up to make Roberts into a propaganda coup.	\N	The Do-Re-Mi Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/8
9	\N	509147	25138	Hitchcock is supervising a transport convoy of new anti-aircraft shell fuses when the convoy is attacked by a German unit. Hitchcock is wounded by a deserter.	\N	The Kingdom Come Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/9
10	\N	509146	25138	The young mute son of British General Simms is kidnapped in a commando raid by Dietrich and taken to Rhodes. The patrol must rescue the boy from the island's garrison with only the help of one Greek resistance fighter.	\N	The Hide-and-Go-Seek Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/10
11	\N	509143	25138	Lieutenant West is on his way to stop a medical supply convoy, when he's ambushed by an Afrika Korps patrol. Wounded and rescued by Moffatt and Pettigrew, before he dies he informs them that he's got to stop the medical supplies, as some are poisonous. When Moffatt destroys the deadly supplies he is put under arrest by a British Army Major.	\N	The Violent Truce Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/11
12	\N	509144	25138	Dietrich traps the Rat Patrol in a cellar. In the cellar are a pregnant woman who has a valuable map, and a resistance fighter who has a personal vendetta with the woman.	\N	The Life-for-a-Life Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/12
13	\N	509141	25138	A British colonel is captured by the Germans after attending a staff meeting which centered on an upcoming Allied offensive. The Rat Patrol is ordered to either rescue or kill him before he can be interrogated. His Sikh aide insists on participating in the mission.	\N	The Fifth Wheel Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/13
14	\N	509157	25138	Moffitt gets into a German-held lighthouse by posing as an electrician, to try to gain information about a German naval convoy headed for North Africa which is carrying Tiger tanks.	\N	The Two If by Sea Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/14
15	\N	509154	25138	Troy hides aerial photographs of secret German installations before being captured by the Gestapo. Then a street urchin finds and tries to sell the photos.	\N	The Street Urchin Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/15
16	\N	509158	25138	A British general is rescued in the desert. He insists upon leading the Rat Patrol on a mission to disrupt a German oil pipeline, despite his deteriorated condition.	\N	The Pipeline to Disaster Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/16
17	\N	509153	25138	A lieutenant is infiltrated by submarine to set up naval gunfire coordinates, but Troy gets suspicious when the officer appears more interested in mapping the Allied positions than the German ones.	\N	The Boomerang Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/17
18	\N	509156	25138	The Rat Patrol uses Moffitt's old flame as a guide to rescue her husband, a French rocket scientist, from the Germans.	\N	The Fatal Reunion Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/18
19	\N	509155	25138	A village's typhus serum is confiscated by the S.S. in order to exchange it for capturing the Rat Patrol. Dietrich questions their methods.	\N	The Decoy Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/19
20	\N	509150	25138	Dietrich and his men capture the Rat Patrol and assume their identities, and thus are able to enter an Allied munitions dump.	\N	The Touch-and-Go Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/20
21	\N	509159	25138	Troy's brother is captured by a German colonel who was injured in an earlier raid by the Rat Patrol.	\N	The Field of Death Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/21
22	\N	509151	25138	The arrival of a team of teenage guerrilla fighters spells ""Double-trouble"" for the Patrol.The embittered young partisans, lead by a 17-year-old Jean-Claude, and his fiery girlfriend, Monique, are determined to do things their way in an unplanned raid in an impenetrable S.S. camp, even though this means putting the Patrol temporarily out of action.	\N	The Double Jeopardy Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/22
23	\N	509152	25138	On the Eve of a dangerous mission, Moffitt receives word that his younger brother has been killed by a German bomb in London.	\N	The Hickory, Dickory Dock Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/23
24	\N	509161	25138	Troy goes undercover to get microfilm from a French Resistance fighter, but they are captured by Dietrich. After Troy refuses to give up the location of the microfilm, Dietrich sentences both to death. Troy must find a way to contact the Rat Patrol for rescue.	\N	The Tug-of-War Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/24
25	\N	509160	25138	Troy and Hitchcock are captured by a German colonel who has a scheme to use them to radio false information back to their headquarters. Meanwhile, Moffitt and Pettigrew's rescue attempts are complicated by an Italian officer who wants to surrender to them.	\N	The Never-Say-Die Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/25
26	\N	509162	25138	The Rat Patrol is ordered to go with a South African sniper on a mission to kill a German general, but Troy decides to try to capture the general alive.	\N	The Kill at Koorlea Raid	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/13908/2/26
