10	\N	408503	19409	A discussion of the waning of ethics and civility in American society. Panelists include Bruce Chapman (Discovery Institute), theologian Richard Mouw, Yale Law School student Saru Jayaraman, linguist John McWhorter and social architect Barbara Marx Hubbard.	\N	Whatever Happened to Ethics and Civility?	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/9567/1/10
