9	\N	445785	21619	Deacon's girlfriend, Susan, seeks Jack's assistance in dealing with her gambling debts.  As Jack investigates outside of the official channels, he uncovers an art forgery ring that has Susan in the middle of it.	\N	Blood Red	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/11141/2/9
10	\N	445783	21619	A blessed statue of the baby Jesus is stolen from St. Michael's Cathedral.  Jack uses his show to find out clues to its whereabouts and to prevent the mob family who donated the statue from exacting their own form of penance on the perpetrator.	\N	Do You Believe in Miracles?	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/11141/2/10
11	\N	445784	21619	The devastating San Francisco earthquake is re-enacted as Jack and Billy help citizens connect with loved ones via the radio waves, Devon has a close encounter, and Zymak and his family re-unite under tense circumstances.	\N	Based on a True Story	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/11141/2/11
12	\N	445781	21619	An abandoned young boy seeks refuge within a modern day band of street thieves with similarities to the Charles Dickens classic, Oliver Twist.	\N	Planes	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/11141/2/12
