4	\N	3445638	239850	In an effort to save a few bucks, Ches elects to bring Mo's head aboard an airplane as carry-on luggage. A demented Doctor Wackerstein barely pilots the air-bus while stewardess Olga preps the passengers on how to save their worthless lives in case of emergency.	\N	Coffee, Tea or Mo?	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/4
5	\N	3445639	239850	A wrong turn from a tour bus leaves our boys stranded at a strange monastery, where there's more monkey business than a barrel of — well, you get the idea.	\N	The Mouse and the Monastery	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/5
6	\N	3445640	239850	It's a hot pursuit in the frozen tundra as Doc and Olga chase Ches and Mo to the Antarctic where a batty anthropologist takes a particular interest in Mo. Mush!	\N	The Missing Mo	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/6
7	\N	3445641	239850	Ches and Mo take the sewer route to a high-seas adventure that finds them hired as pirates by an old familiar friend, while Doc, Olga and The Brain give chase aboard a luxury cruise ship. Anchors aweigh!	\N	Bottles Away	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/7
8	\N	3445642	239850	Ches naps in the park and dreams about himself, Mo, Doc and Olga under the same roof in an old-folks' home. Strained gumballs, anyone?	\N	Old Friends	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/8
9	\N	3445647	239850	Tired of constant heartburn from a horrid diet, Mo's heart pops a few stitches in the monster's chest, hops out and decides to see the world, leaving behind a heartless, one-eyed goofball suddenly with no scruples.	\N	Heartless Mo	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/9
10	\N	3445663	239850	Beware ye… goes nowhere near the haunted house with possessed plumbing! Do you think our two idiots heed the warning? Yeah, right.	\N	Bad Plumbing	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/10
