15	\N	3445680	239850	\N	\N	I Married a Monster	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/15
16	\N	3445681	239850	Mo's sonic snoring tops a litany of annoyances that prevent Ches from getting a good night's sleep. And when Mo's body goes sleepwalking, an exhausted Ches tows Mo's head along in middle of the night on a city-wide search for the monster's torso.	\N	Sleep Tight	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/16
17	\N	3445682	239850	In this epic tale, Doc Wackerstein's Mo Voodoo doll ends up in the clutches of a toy conglomerate and ultimately into the hands of millions of pin-plunging kids worldwide. Oooch! Ouch! Eech! Yowch!	\N	Who Do That Voodoo Like Mo Do?	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/10700/1/17
