1	\N	3700909	292175	70 year old Sundari, fed up of her son's coddling, plots her escape towards an unknown destination joined by her granddaughter Niveditha and daughter-in-law Kaveri. Niveditha, a 24 year old cricketer wants to get away from her boyfriend who she's at an impasse with while Kaveri, 'who's just a mother', has had enough of her thankless service to the family.	/2hqoYpNo90o1pMZUUb3F9ppKFfX.jpg	A woman like you	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/1
2	\N	4556761	292175	The trio rest for the night at a questionable motel. Kaveri strikes an unlikely friendship. Rajaratnam's sudden and untimely sickness threatens their trip.	/aCG80qPavdhz3rZWuHk52iSGwbb.jpg	Escape velocity	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/2
3	\N	4556764	292175	After Sundari thwarts her son's efforts, the women land up at a cultural festival. Nivi stumbles upon an exciting prospect. Kaveri is visited by a ghost from the past. The trio have to deal with an unexpected problem.	/yX77qeDctUOa6Qks83Qe3ijCcB6.jpg	A different beat	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/3
4	\N	4556766	292175	The trio's car breaks down in the middle of nowhere. They take refuge in a small village in the back of beyond, where Kaveri meets her counterpart. Sundari seeks an address. Nivi begins to understand her mother.	/ppawjQjv4hOaZpfGfwbg6bWu7yT.jpg	Break from a break	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/4
5	\N	4556769	292175	On Sundari's cue, the women embark on a temple trip, where they bump into a foreign couple. Nivi is surprised to find Vikram at a local market, who invites the women to camp with his gang. Kaveri visits a gharana with Vikram. Sundari finally gets the address she's been after.	/hbMkWRnUK4pSyXNEMTb0y0ljbRB.jpg	Just a mother	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/5
6	\N	4556771	292175	A major disagreement drives a wedge between the women. As Julia and Robert get married, the women find themselves revisiting their pasts.	/xKsAuTFgpb0cYVYmEEk7UNtojQk.jpg	Are you happy?	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/6
7	\N	4556774	292175	Nivi and Kaveri rue their behaviour as they wait to hear from the doctor. Kaveri calls Rajaratnam after what seems like a lifetime. Nivi realises she knows nothing about her folks.	/klJ4vQ4dWUQl9ywb0IJr4tcCEph.jpg	Hearing is not listening	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/7
8	\N	4556776	292175	The family is reunited. Just as the women begin to rejoice on their new and improved lives, there is a knock on the door.	/fkdSJtzv92FfhglCuy9PeS7Bcy7.jpg	Rule Number 5	https://vidsrc.to/embed/tv/201088/1/8
